{"sourceUrl":"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/75/a5/c13324a226725/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.273250+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/75/a5/c13324a226725/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><h1><br/></h1><p><span>在《关于中国药科大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名的通知》（药大研函〔</span><span>2025</span><span>〕</span><span>28</span><span><span><span>号）、《</span><span><span>生命科学与技术学院</span></span></span></span><span>2026</span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》基础上，</span><span><span>学</span></span><span>院制定第二轮报名细则如下：</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、硕士</strong></span><span><span><strong>推免生可</strong></span></span><span><strong>接收第二轮报名的专业：</strong></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>类别</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>071000</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>100705</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>微生物与生化药学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>学术学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>1007Z4</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>海洋药物学</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>01</span></span></span><span><span><span>生物制药工程</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>09</span></span></span><span><span><span>抗体工程与细胞治疗</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>生物与医药</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>基因治疗与核酸药物</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>105500</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>生物药物发现与转化</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>二、报名条件</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>全国高校</span><span>2026</span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、基础医学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、食品科学与工程类、数据科学类、人工智能与计算机类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校免试推荐资格。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>同一学院内仅能填报一个硕士志愿。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>、</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>报名方式和时间</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>系统报名第二轮开放时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>14</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>报名方式：登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span></span><span><span><span>），如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。系统账户考生需自行注册使用，注册时须填写个人真实有效信息。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院对申请人资格进行审核，确定入选名单，并于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span><span><span><span>日前在系统内审核通过，未审核通过即未入选，请自行查看。入选同学须于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>24:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>前在报名系统中回复确认是否参加，逾期未回复者视为自动放弃，</span></span></span><span>并向学院邮箱发送签名</span></span><span>过的《诚信复试承诺书》</span><span><span>pdf</span></span><span><span><span><span>版</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>22</span><span><span><span>日前，各接收</span><span><span>第</span></span><span>二轮报名的学科开展线上面试考核，线上会议</span><span><span>安排等后续由各学科通知各位考生</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四</strong></span></span><span><strong>、报名材料（</strong></span><span><span><strong>系统内需</strong></span></span><span><strong>上传附件）</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>身份证或在读学生证（必填）；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>外语水平证明，如</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span>获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></p><p><span>7.</span><span>推免硕士生是否提交《专家推荐书》不做硬性要求。</span></p><p><span><span><span>报考硕士研究生的材料由学院进行资格审核。</span><span><span><span>申请人在网上填报及向学院提交的各类信息、材料，必须真实准确。若发现申请材料有虚假成分，一经查实将取消申请人一切由此获得的利益，并保留追诉的权利。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五</strong></span></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span><span><strong>复试安排</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>复试形式：线上面试。</span></p><p><span>每名申请人须准备一段</span><span>3</span><span>分钟左右</span><span>PPT</span><span><span><span>，</span><span><span>包括个人情况</span></span><span>介绍</span><span><span>及</span></span><span>本科期间科研</span><span><span>经历等</span></span><span>，须</span><span><span>提前</span></span><span>熟悉共享屏幕操作。</span><span><span>其他要求由学科组通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第二轮</span><span><span>报名复试</span></span><span>结果由学校审核后</span><span><span>系统内</span></span><span>发布。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>政审表和承诺书原件</span><span><span>可</span></span><span>在</span><span><span>复试通过后寄送，等待学科通知。（</span></span><span>为确保及时送达，务必用顺丰且用黑粗笔在快递包裹背面写上“政审表”。</span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>六、联系方式</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span>025-86185397</span></span><span><span>；邮箱：</span></span><span><span>ariel66@126.com</span></span><span><span>，许老师</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本实施方案最终解释权归</span><span><span>生命科学与技术学院</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://sky.cpu.edu.cn/75/a5/c13324a226725/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>欢迎各位同学报名！</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>生命科学与技术学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"42ca4ae569a2a14273c0735d5946effa771a9c5f9de55159c801e2ec7127e6c1","textLength":1444,"sourceSha256":"18a6771c2c3145b74ecd2ea4f7a90b2bae9c1c2e379f5879ab08d3044be23031","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-538ee9ae61dddc14ac96","title":"2025年中国药科大学生命科学与技术学院接收推免生预报名第二轮通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:55.273250+00:00"}
